   "section": "Experience",
   "text": "Senior Backend Engineer, Northwind Logistics (2022 - present)\n- Designed an event-driven order tracking platform on Kafka handling 40k messages per second.\n- Built FastAPI services backed by PostgreSQL, cutting p95 latency from 480 ms to 120 ms.\n- Managed all AWS infrastructure with Terraform modules and mentored four engineers.\nBackend Engineer, Brightwave Analytics (2019 - 2022)\n- Developed REST APIs in Python and FastAPI for a customer reporting product.\n- Tuned PostgreSQL queries and indexes, reducing nightly batch time by 60 percent.\n- Introduced CI pipelines with GitHub Actions and Docker image builds.\nSoftware Engineer, Lumen Retail Systems (2017 - 2019)\n- Maintained Django services for inventory and pricing.\n- Wrote Python ETL jobs that loaded supplier feeds into PostgreSQL."
  },
