   "text": "- Design and build scalable backend services in Python using FastAPI.\n- Own PostgreSQL schemas, queries and performance tuning.\n- Build event-driven pipelines on a message broker such as Kafka.\n- Run services in production, including on-call and incident response.\n- Mentor engineers and review code."
  },
